  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Maputo Water Supply Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project concerns the development construction and operation of the Corumana system. This system consists of a raw water intake and transmission system and a drinking water treatment plant with a capacity of 60000 m3  for clear water distribution and  6 main distribution centers.</narrative>
  </description>
